# src/blob/span_types.rs is generated by syncdown's Gradle `generateSpanTypes`
# task from span_types.toml, but is committed rather than ignored: `mod
# span_types` in blob.rs means an ignored file leaves a fresh checkout unable to
# compile, so CI could never build. Regenerating it is idempotent, and a real
# change to span_types.toml should land here as a visible diff.
